[[File:HammerheadSafespot.png|thumb|Land Safespot]]
'''Hammerhead sharks''' are monsters found in the [[Western Ocean]], [[Sunset Ocean]], and [[Ardent Ocean]]. The player may be assigned to kill them as a [[bounty task]] starting at 40 [[Sailing]]. A guaranteed bounty task can be received from [[Port Khazard]].

Sharks just east of Corsair Cove are able to be safespotted on boat from across the rock formations they spawn amongst, making them ideal for reducing damage taken on bounty tasks. Also, can be safespotted on land at southern most point below [[Equa leaves]] spawn below start location of [[Big Chompy Bird Hunting]] quest. Will require some specific positioning, patience and a weapon on long range to tag and lure them in. 

Any boat with a [[rune keel]] or better will not take any damage from hammerhead sharks.

[[File:Hammerhead shark safespotting.png|thumb|right|300px|Safespotting them east of Corsair Cove.]]
